    "title": "Hanwha Defense USA investing $2 million in Opelika facility - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Talia Cavalline ,\n5 hours ago OPELIKA, Ala. (WTVM) - Hanwha Defense USA is investing over $2 million in its Opelika facility to enhance the combat vehicle industry. This will be Opelika’s first national defense initiative and will strengthen the city’s economy. The investment will create 40 new jobs at the North Park Drive facility. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
